Output demo/proofkit-claude-code-demo.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1100
Set Height 650
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Theme "Dracula"

Hide
Type "cd /Users/himanshu/projects/proofkit"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "claude -p 'There is a bug: running python demo/top_n_buggy.py 5 3 9 1 7 5 crashes. Capture this bug using proofkit before doing anything else, then briefly report what you did.' --dangerously-skip-permissions"
Enter
Sleep 25s
